---
import Button from '../ui/Button.astro';

const whatsappUrl = 'https://wa.me/59892497675';
---

<section
  class="relative min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center bg-deep overflow-hidden py-24 md:py-32"
>
  <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-10">
    <div
      class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-gold/5 via-transparent to-gold/5"
    >
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="container-padding relative z-10 w-full">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-16 xl:gap-20 items-center lg:items-stretch">
      <div class="text-center lg:text-left flex flex-col justify-center lg:justify-between h-full py-1 lg:py-2">
        <div>
          <span
            class="font-heading font-light text-gold text-lg sm:text-xl lg:text-2xl tracking-wide block mb-3 lg:mb-5 fade-in"
          >
            Hola, soy Flor
          </span>
          <h1
            class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl xl:text-6xl font-semibold text-parchment tracking-wide leading-tight lg:leading-[1.12] fade-in-delay-1"
          >
            Acompañamiento y Sesiones para Parejas, Crianza y Dinámicas Familiares
          </h1>
          <p
            class="font-body font-light text-parchment/80 text-base sm:text-lg lg:text-xl xl:text-2xl leading-relaxed mt-6 lg:mt-8 max-w-xl mx-auto lg:mx-0 reveal"
          >
            Un espacio para destrabar la comunicación, comprender la historia de tu sistema y transformar los patrones repetitivos de tus vínculos.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center lg:justify-start gap-4 lg:gap-5 mt-8 lg:mt-10 reveal reveal-delay-1">
          <Button href="/servicios" variant="outline">
            Ver Sesiones
          </Button>
          <Button href={whatsappUrl} variant="primary" external>
            Agendar Sesión en WhatsApp
          </Button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex justify-center lg:justify-end items-center reveal">
        <img
          src="/img/01.jpeg"
          alt="Florencia Villeneuve"
          class="aspect-[3/4] max-w-sm lg:max-w-md w-full object-cover rounded-sm border border-gold/20 shadow-2xl"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

